{"id":950,"slug":"eyes-without-a-face","title":"Eyes Without a Face","year":1960,"country":"France","duration":90,"spine":260,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/950-eyes-without-a-face","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/19431863841861d74f7712060bff99e9/vOHVeymeS3E2Iw9WNwxzVTlVswMV45_large.jpg","description":"At his secluded château in the French countryside, a brilliant, obsessive doctor (Pierre Brasseur) attempts a radical plastic surgery to restore the beauty of his daughter’s disfigured countenance—at a horrifying price. Eyes Without a Face, directed by the supremely talented Georges Franju, is rare in horror cinema for its odd mixture of the ghastly and the lyrical, and it has been a major influence on the genre in the decades since its release. There are images here—of terror, of gore, of inexplicable beauty—that once seen are never forgotten.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Georges Franju","slug":"georges-franju"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Pierre Brasseur","role":"Dr. Génessier","slug":"pierre-brasseur"},{"actor":"Alida Valli","role":"Louise","slug":"alida-valli"},{"actor":"François Guérin","role":"Jacques Vernon","slug":"francois-guerin"},{"actor":"Edith Scob","role":"Christiane Génessier","slug":"edith-scob"},{"actor":"Juliette Mayniel","role":"Edna Grüberg","slug":"juliette-mayniel"},{"actor":"Alexandre Rignault","role":"Detective Parot","slug":"alexandre-rignault"},{"actor":"Béatrice Altariba","role":"Paulette Mérodon","slug":"beatrice-altariba"},{"actor":"Charles Blavette","role":"Dog-pound employee","slug":"charles-blavette"},{"actor":"Claude Brasseur","role":"Second police detective","slug":"claude-brasseur"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Georges Franju","slug":"georges-franju"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Jules Borkon","slug":null},{"role":"Based on the novel by","person":"Jean Redon","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay adaptation by","person":"Pierre Boileau","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay adaptation by